{{no sources|date=August 2025}} '''Wulin Academy of Arts''' ( [[Chinese language|Chinese]] : 武林書畫院) is a learnt society and cultural institution of [[Hangzhou|Wulin]], the ancient name of Hangzhou. The academy is located on the shores of [[West Lake]] in [[Hangzhou]], China. It was founded in 1995, but its antecedents dates back to the Southern [[Song dynasty]]. [[Category:China]] {{asia-stub}}

